&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Binance is a leading global blockchain ecosystem behind the world’s largest cryptocurrency exchange by trading volume and registered users. We are trusted by 300+ million people in 100+ countries for our industry-leading security, user fund transparency, trading engine speed, deep liquidity, and an unmatched portfolio of digital-asset products. Binance offerings range from trading and finance to education, research, payments, institutional services, and more. Our mission is to increase the freedom of money and financial access for people around the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities / 岗位职责:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with creative merchandise (swag) sourcing for global campaigns, proposing innovative product combinations across various themes.&lt;br&gt;协助全球周边项目的创意选品，能够提供多主题的创新搭配。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support communication with vendors and designers, evaluate materials and production techniques, and follow up on sample development and production.&lt;br&gt;参与周边设计沟通、材质工艺评估及样品打样跟进。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools to assist with data analysis, merchandise selection, cost estimation, and competitor merchandise benchmarking.&lt;br&gt;熟练使用 AI 工具辅助数据分析、选品分析、成本测算及竞品周边监测。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate merchandise requirements from different regions, track project progress, provide status updates, and assist with inventory management.&lt;br&gt;协助整理各地区周边需求，跟踪项目进度并及时反馈，同时协助库存管理。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requirements / 岗位要求:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creativity in merchandise and gift curation, with the ability to quickly develop multiple well-thought-out product bundle ideas.&lt;br&gt;礼品创意力强，能够快速提供多种合理搭配套组。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual English/Mandarin is required to be able to coordinate with overseas partners and stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;需具备中英文双语沟通能力，以便与海外合作伙伴及相关利益方进行高效协作。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, highly organized, and able to manage multiple projects simultaneously with strong execution skills.&lt;br&gt;做事细心缜密，逻辑清晰，执行力强，能够高效推进多线并行任务。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong aesthetic sense, with a good understanding of brand identity, market trends, and user preferences.&lt;br&gt;审美良好，对品牌调性、流行趋势及用户偏好具有敏锐洞察力。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in merchandise production, promotional products, corporate gifts, or branded merchandise is preferred.&lt;br&gt;有周边制作、品牌礼品或相关行业经验者优先。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Binance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of finance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with world-class talent in a user-centric global organization with a flat structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle challenging projects in a fast-paced and innovative enviornment with autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a results-driven workplace with opportunities for career growth and continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and company benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first, work-from-home arrangement (may vary depending on the nature of the role and team)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Binance is committed to being an equal opportunity employer. We believe that having a diverse workforce is fundamental to our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting a job application, you acknowledge that you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.binance.com/en/candidate/privacy/notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of the hiring process, such as reviewing applications, analyzing resumes, or assessing responses and identifying potential inconsistencies or verification signals in application materials based on available information. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgment. Final hiring decisions are ultimately made by humans. If you would like more information about how your data is processed, please contact us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Binance is a leading global blockchain ecosystem behind the world’s largest cryptocurrency exchange by trading volume and registered users. We are trusted by 300+ million people in 100+ countries for our industry-leading security, user fund transparency, trading engine speed, deep liquidity, and an unmatched portfolio of digital-asset products. Binance offerings range from trading and finance to education, research, payments, institutional services, and more. Our mission is to increase the freedom of money and financial access for people around the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of Simple Earn mechanisms, especially in the Flexible Simple Earn and Loan products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in executing growth campaigns and communications to drive user acquisition, engagement, and product growth for Simple Earn, working closely with Product, Marketing, Customer Service, and KOL/Affiliate teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help monitor daily Simple Earn product performance, flag product-related issues, and support troubleshooting with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track campaign and growth initiative performance through data analysis, user insights, and feedback; prepare regular reports and share market and competitor insights on Earn and DeFi products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support research and outreach to token partners, and help explore new collaboration opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the team in managing VIP and institutional clients, including preparing materials and assisting with onboarding to Earn products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of assigned tasks and learn the full Earn product and operations workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing or recently completed a Bachelor’s degree or above in Business, Finance, Marketing, Economics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of crypto Earn products, TradFi products, DeFi ecosystems, and Lending/Borrowing mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship or project experience in operations, growth, product marketing, partnerships, or business development is preferred (crypto, fintech, TradFi, or internet platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good analytical and user insight skills with a sound business sense.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and collaboration skills with internal teams and external token project partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, responsible, and detail-oriented, with a strong focus on KPIs and results; able to thrive in a fast-paced and high-pressure environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual English/Mandarin &lt;strong&gt;is required to be able to coordinate with overseas partners and stakeholders.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English &lt;strong&gt;is required to be able to coordinate with overseas partners and stakeholders. &lt;/strong&gt;Additional languages would be an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Binance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of finance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with world-class talent in a user-centric global organization with a flat structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle challenging projects in a fast-paced and innovative enviornment with autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a results-driven workplace with opportunities for career growth and continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and company benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first, work-from-home arrangement (may vary depending on the nature of the role and team)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Binance is committed to being an equal opportunity employer. We believe that having a diverse workforce is fundamental to our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting a job application, you acknowledge that you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.binance.com/en/candidate/privacy/notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of the hiring process, such as reviewing applications, analyzing resumes, or assessing responses and identifying potential inconsistencies or verification signals in application materials based on available information. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgment. Final hiring decisions are ultimately made by humans. If you would like more information about how your data is processed, please contact us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact — understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our team pairs deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: solution go-live, solution adoption, initial value realization support and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern, you will have the unique opportunity to learn and grow through hands-on experiences. Your role will involve utilizing our cutting-edge AI deployment tools to develop innovative solutions for our customers, together with more experienced Deployment Engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional engineering role where you build everything manually. You will be introduced to AI-augmented and business-focused software delivery: helping specify what needs to be built, learning to direct AI agents to execute, and assisting in validating the results. Participation in team meetings and workshops will offer valuable insights into the decision-making process within the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Initiate and Connect&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct customer-facing sessions with experienced Deployment Engineers to discuss ongoing projects, translate strategic objectives into use cases, and receive guidance on best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in gathering and organizing relevant data from various sources, ensuring data accuracy and consistency for analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn to direct AI deployment agents (like Apollo) to build data models, process analyses, KPIs, and dashboards by helping to write clear specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct exploratory data analysis, utilizing Celonis and other tools to uncover trends, process inefficiencies, and root causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in defining the initial solution design blueprint and configuring operational solutions across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Value &amp;amp; Rollout&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the validation of AI-generated outputs for accuracy and business relevance alongside senior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop and maintain KPIs to track the success of project initiatives and quantify business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in documenting solution design decisions and configurations for future reference and customer handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes This Role Different in the AI Era&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will learn to work with AI agents as your primary tools, focusing on validating and refining their output rather than writing every line of code manually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop foundational specification and context engineering skills to help translate business needs into precise AI instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As you navigate a fast-paced environment, you will learn how to adapt quickly to changes and new approaches as AI capabilities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications You Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Student of Technology Management, Business (-Informatics), Computer Science, Engineering, Economics, or a comparable degree program with outstanding performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know-how in Business Intelligence, data analytics, and a foundational understanding of enterprise business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in programming and working with databases; knowledge in SQL, Python, or related coding- and/or database query languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and basic familiarity with AI-assisted development tools, coupled with an eagerness to learn prompt/context engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in working with customers, along with awesome presentation and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to demonstrate initiative, work independently, and think outside of the box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and German (any additional language is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 months of full-time availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of p

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Binance is a leading global blockchain ecosystem behind the world’s largest cryptocurrency exchange by trading volume and registered users. We are trusted by 300+ million people in 100+ countries for our industry-leading security, user fund transparency, trading engine speed, deep liquidity, and an unmatched portfolio of digital-asset products. Binance offerings range from trading and finance to education, research, payments, institutional services, and more. Our mission is to increase the freedom of money and financial access for people around the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Customer Support is extremely important for us and we hope to create a platform where our users are well supported with excellent quality, fast response time, and accurate information.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support is via ticketing system and a live chat and will include but not limited to customer queries, complaints, and identification approval processes for our world-class cryptocurrency exchange platform.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support will be in Spanish &amp;amp; English, applicants need to speak both languages.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle back office tickets, and provide 7*24h online enquiry and email reply services to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer enquiries, advice and suggestions via email or online tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other business units with customer liaison, accurately document customer requests and advice, and provide feedback in the form of documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer complaints, special cases or ad hoc tasks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
