&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our International Customer Success team led by Philippe, Director of Customer Success. The team consists of around ten Consultants based across Barcelona and Paris, covering a global portfolio of B2B and B2C accounts. Together, you&#39;ll be ensuring each client&#39;s marketplace reaches its full performance potential — acting as the strategic backbone behind their growth.&lt;/div&gt;
