&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Serve as the strategic and functional point of reference for B2B and B2C clients across both project and run phases — running tailored workshops with C-level stakeholders, shaping marketplace strategy, and keeping projects firmly on track to go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Build personalised post-launch action plans with each client, lead data-driven business reviews, and translate KPI analysis into concrete growth recommendations for marketplace teams and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define seller and customer strategies, benchmark against leading global marketplaces, and leverage the latest e-commerce trends and Mirakl product features to continuously drive client performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work cross-functionally with Mirakl&#39;s Business and IT teams to anticipate risks early, align on priorities, and ensure clients extract maximum value from the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
